{"seq":29,"slug":"technical-debt-governance","title":"技术债务管理","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance","rating":{"composite":4.16,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 技术债务管理\n\n技术债务是软件工程中最具金融隐喻色彩的概念之一。Ward Cunningham 在 1992 年提出这一比喻时，他想表达的并不是\"代码写得烂\"，而是一种有意识的权衡——为了短期交付速度而接受的长期维护成本。2026 年，全球技术债务规模已达 3.6 万亿美元，AI 生成代码正在以前所未有的速度制造新的债务来源，使得系统化管理技术债务成为每个工程团队的核心能力。\n\n本 hub 聚焦于技术债务的全生命周期管理：从理解债务的本质与分类，到通过工具和方法精准识别，再到制定优先级并系统性偿还，最终建立预防机制阻止新债务的失控积累。\n\n## 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界\n\n本 hub 专注于技术债务的管理方法论与实践工具链。与之相关但边界清晰的兄弟 hub 包括：\n\n- **软件架构师**（`07_software-architect`）：覆盖架构评审、演进式架构与适应度函数等架构层面的治理手段，本 hub 从债务管理的角度引用其中的架构适应度函数和技术债评估方法，但不重复架构设计本身的内容。\n- **架构决策记录**（`19_architecture-decision-records`）：专注于决策文档化与治理流程，本 hub 在预防章节中引用 ADR 作为防止架构债务的关键实践，但不展开 ADR 的写法与模板。\n\n简言之：本 hub 是\"债务管理的操作手册\"，架构师 hub 是\"架构能力的培养体系\"，ADR hub 是\"决策追溯的方法论\"。\n\n## 推荐学习路径\n\n对于不同背景的读者，建议按以下顺序学习：\n\n1. **初次接触技术债务概念的开发者**：从 foundations 开始，理解隐喻、分类和经济学原理，再进入 identification 学习工具实操，最后阅读 remediation 和 prevention。\n2. **有经验的技术负责人 / Tech Lead**：可跳过 foundations 中的基础概念，直接从 identification 的工具链开始，重点关注 remediation 中的优先级框架和路线图设计，以及 prevention 中的组织实践。\n3. **关注架构健康度的架构师**：重点阅读 identification 中的架构一致性测试、prevention 中的适应度函数，并结合兄弟 hub 的架构治理内容。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 基本的软件工程概念（版本控制、CI/CD、代码审查）\n- 对重构和代码质量有初步认识\n- 了解敏捷开发的基本流程（Sprint、Backlog）\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"技术债务基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"debt-metaphor-and-quadrant","title":"技术债务隐喻与四象限分类","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/foundations/debt-metaphor-and-quadrant"},{"seq":2,"slug":"debt-types-and-taxonomy","title":"技术债务类型与分类学","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/foundations/debt-types-and-taxonomy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"debt-economics-and-interest","title":"技术债务经济学与利息模型","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/foundations/debt-economics-and-interest"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"identification","title":"技术债务识别与度量","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/identification","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"static-analysis-tools","title":"静态分析工具链实践","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/identification/static-analysis-tools"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hotspot-and-complexity-analysis","title":"热点与复杂度分析","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/identification/hotspot-and-complexity-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"architecture-conformance-testing","title":"架构一致性测试","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/identification/architecture-conformance-testing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"remediation","title":"技术债务偿还策略","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/remediation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prioritization-frameworks","title":"技术债务优先级框架","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/remediation/prioritization-frameworks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"refactoring-strategies","title":"渐进式重构策略","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/remediation/refactoring-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"remediation-roadmap","title":"偿还路线图设计与执行跟踪","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/remediation/remediation-roadmap"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"prevention","title":"技术债务预防机制","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/prevention","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quality-gates-and-ci","title":"CI/CD 质量门禁实践","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/prevention/quality-gates-and-ci"},{"seq":2,"slug":"architecture-fitness-functions","title":"架构适应度函数设计","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/prevention/architecture-fitness-functions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"organizational-practices","title":"组织级债务预防实践","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-governance/prevention/organizational-practices"}]}]}